WEBVTT

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:23.610
We've managed to evacuate 80
percent of the citizens so far.

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:30.690
Worst case, we can escort the remaining 20
percent into the castle in under four hours.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:36.090
Is there even any point to defending our sovereignty now?

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.720
<i>Even General True died because of me.</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.970
Your Majesty, please do not give up hope.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:49.930
The Krisnan people fought hard to
regain their independence 80 years ago.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:54.860
That sense of pride will not waver, even if we surrender!

00:00:54.860 --> 00:01:00.210
Do you think it will fade under Athenian rule?

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:03.780
No. There would soon be another conflict.
And that is why we must fight!

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.200
I know that.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.250
An urgent message from our scouts!

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.070
What is it?

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.130
Excuse me.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:14.500
They've broken through our advance camps.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:22.800
A massive Athenian army broke through
our borders and are headed our way.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:26.230
Speed up the citizen's evacuation.

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:28.160
One more thing, ma'am.

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:29.530
Now what!?

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:33.790
Heavy Knight 1st Class Rygart has headed
into enemy territory to rescue his brother,

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:38.610
and the Millennium Squadron is
proceeding to recover the Delphine.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:42.530
What is Rygart's... no, the
Millennium Squadron's situation?

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:44.510
Unknown.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.870
What happened to the guards placed with Rygart's brother?

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:54.720
I had specifically arranged for protection.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.440
I'm very sorry, sir.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:07.640
Your Majesty...

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.710
Send a message to all our remaining forces.

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:12.980
Withdraw to the capital immediately.

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:59.690
I've heard all about you.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:03.090
What are you trying to say?

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:09.480
Look at you. You even sacrificed
the comrades who came to your aid.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:13.600
You and I are fellow traitors.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:17.540
Here's some advice from your senior traitor.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:21.400
Don't worry about it.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:24.350
The dead are nothing but pathetic weaklings.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:27.850
These weakling's very existence is evil; a sin.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:32.410
They survive only by dragging down people like us.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:37.470
So don't worry too much

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:39.120
even if you caused their deaths.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:48.300
Even if the others lose their lives here, it's not your fault.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.810
They're just buffoons.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.100
Double plated steel?!

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.100
That isn't an ordinary sword!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:36.100
<i>If he had penetrated any further, I'd be dead.</i>

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:46.610
<i>You had no issues throwing aside your rifle,
yet you still cling to your spear?</i>

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.530
Too slow.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.460
You were a formidable adversary.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.320
So this is how it ends, huh?

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:08.240
Spare me the pain and get it over with quickly.

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:10.240
I shall.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:20.410
Your elbow joint didn't break.
Did you reinforce the frame?

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.290
I must say, I'm grateful to the king.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:44.340
Don't get carried away!

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:01.950
Die!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.350
Goodnight!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.270
Who the hell's piloting that thing?

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:53.240
We're more alike than I had thought.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:57.660
Your dad said the same thing...

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.080
Really now?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:04.760
Yeah! You act so high and mighty and
you're spouting crap like that all the time!

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:07.540
You make me sick!

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.190
But...

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:10.090
But what?

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.010
But you're just a little shit!

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:15.240
Oh, I'm well aware of that.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:18.600
There! That's exactly what I'm talking about!

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:23.540
Unlike me, you're a genius who can
accomplish anything, but all you do is fuck around!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:27.410
While everyone else is fighting for
their lives, you just sit and watch!

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:29.550
Couldn't have said it better myself.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.320
Then tell me, Rygart. What are <i>you</i> doing?

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:37.260
What do you fight for?

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:42.650
Spare me the crap about defending
your homeland. What is it you really want?

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.450
What do I want?

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.290
Yes. The real reason that you've tried to hide.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:53.260
Did you really think nobody noticed?

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:54.920
I...

00:08:55.900 --> 00:09:00.600
If you come back unharmed... I'll stop being angry.

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:07.600
It's the talk of the castle.
The way our dear Queen looks at you...

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.530
What're you talking about?

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:16.430
That beautiful head doesn't turn for just any man.

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:18.940
Not that it's any of my business, mind you.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:24.290
Hey, I know! How about this?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:29.510
If you can beat me, I'll grant your wish.
Your one true desire.

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:35.690
I'll storm the castle, grab the Queen, and place her in your arms!

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.850
Doesn't that just sound wonderful?

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:49.720
You don't get it. I'm here to protect the royal family.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:51.560
Anyone who would attack them is my enemy!

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:57.900
Then let's settle the score right now, once and for all.

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:00.820
Sure. I'm happy to oblige.

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:10.660
Kneeling before your enemy? A classic counterattack stance.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:14.690
Either that or a bold move by
one man up against a hundred.

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:18.770
No matter.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.430
I'll crush you like a bug, Golem and all!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.890
<i>His footwork is unbelievable!</i>

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.150
<i>If I tried to get up, I'd be dead!</i>

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:31.650
<i>Hang in there!</i>

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:36.700
<i>Just until Girghe extends his upper body!</i>

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.700
He said the same thing.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:58.810
Your old man told me not to mourn the dead!

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:04.750
He didn't mean it in quite the same way,
but it still makes me furious!

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:10.150
You said you'd grant my wish if I won, right?

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.170
Then if I do...

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:17.110
Become a general!

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.850
Surpass your father!

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:32.500
I found you!

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:36.080
Damn it!

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.260
We gotta go! We can't stay here!

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:43.050
Black Golem, I will destroy you!

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:46.970
Gi—

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.220
Girghe!

00:11:57.220 --> 00:12:00.400
I will squash you!

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:36.390
I wasn't expecting you to
still be in the area, black Golem.

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:39.240
And you too, Artemis of Krisna.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:44.820
To think that settling matters here is a bit unsatisfying.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:52.250
These men, who stand in front of you
have been sent by the General,

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:55.240
are an army of elites!

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.440
Come on, Delphine! Get up!

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:15.290
Very good, let's go Spartan Squad...

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:16.750
bring out your warrior spirit!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.940
<i>He relinquished his tactical position very quickly.</i>

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.740
He changed his battle stance in midair?!

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:14.540
I can't believe I'm having such a difficult time
shooting down obsolete technology from Artemis!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.960
Oh? I was supposed to be in your blind spot...

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:29.800
A faulty Golem like you should know its place.

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:35.260
My Archilles is the culmination
of wealth from the Tupel family.

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:39.170
This Golem is from the highest quality
quartz and most advanced technology.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:49.530
He was able to penetrate the
Golem with just his pressure gun?

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:53.490
Sir Tupel was...

00:14:56.410 --> 00:15:00.620
Captain Daphne, the heir of Tupel was shot down!

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:04.240
If he had not used his connections, he never
would have been allowed to join this squad.

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:06.840
I never thought of him as part of this squad.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.440
Let's go, Teuton!

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:09.300
Roger!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.290
Teuton, fall back!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.230
Understood!

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:16.100
Teuton,

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.530
I can't get a good shot with you in the way!

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:29.630
Damn, Artemis of Krisna...

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:33.040
...who is remaining at a close enough distance to keep
Teuton hostage, but not far enough to let us attack!

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:35.380
Teuton... prepare for the worst!

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.350
Understood!

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:41.060
I'm prepared to die!

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.080
What incredible accuracy!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.620
But... I'm sure I hit him!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.210
Girghe!

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:28.060
Artemis of Krisna.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.980
Your Golem is heavily damaged along
with your foot being completely destroyed.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.490
What do you hope to accomplish?

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.400
Surrender peacefully.

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:56.840
It had to end like this!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.640
Listen well...

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:06.440
I'm Bades, an executive officer of the General of Athens!

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.900
If your heroism...

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.570
ended here...

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:19.220
it would be a great loss for the
history of this whole continent!

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:34.320
Join Athens!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.650
I'd be willing to compromise...

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.550
to get a man of your ability!

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:55.100
I decline.

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:08.130
A torn frame pierces rather well.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:14.710
What about you?

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:16.480
Would you join Krisna?

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:18.700
Although, I wouldn't go as far
to do anything for you though.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:53.840
I can imagine that by now you have
exhausted all your tricks, Artemis of Krisna.

00:19:56.700 --> 00:20:00.680
This is a great feeling even better
when one is about to violate a woman.

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:04.790
Girghe!

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:39.700
Gir—

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:08.750
Girghe!

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:18.090
Krisna is not worthy of having such a skillful man.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:21.230
After you kill me...

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:22.980
join Athens.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:29.630
Only after a war splits a continent in
two is when your true ability comes out.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:33.000
Okay, I'll think about it.

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:35.880
Sir... Sir Bades!

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:42.510
Sir Bades!

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:47.310
Girghe!

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:55.180
What the hell are you doing?!

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.650
Hurry and run away, idiot!

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:02.450
Girghe!

00:23:50.850 --> 00:23:51.670
Girghe...

00:23:51.670 --> 00:23:55.220
What were you trying to tell me?

00:23:55.770 --> 00:23:59.020
Last stand, impenetrable fortress.
